      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Baseline TiVNbTa has a yield strength of approximately 330 MPa at 1273 K.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Baseline TiVNbTa has a compressive strength of approximately 423 MPa at 1273 K and about 30% strain.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is incorporation of 5–10 at.% W into TiVNbTa by arc melting.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "W incorporation will increase lattice distortion in the BCC matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512535::web::015::3_3_1_mechanical_properties_at_room_temp"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The W-induced lattice distortion will hinder dislocation motion.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512535::web::015::3_3_1_mechanical_properties_at_room_temp"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "W-induced lattice distortion will delay thermal softening at 1273 K.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "W will strengthen TiVNbTa primarily through solid-solution strengthening.",
