      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512535::web::015::3_3_1_mechanical_properties_at_room_temp"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "MoNbTaW and MoNbTaVW HEAs exhibit high-temperature strength retention analogous to that predicted for W-modified TiVNbTa.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A suitably optimized W addition can preserve a single-phase BCC structure without deleterious phase transformations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding W will increase the yield strength of TiVNbTa at 1273 K.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512535::web::015::3_3_1_mechanical_properties_at_room_temp"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding W will increase the compressive strength of TiVNbTa at 1273 K.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7512535::web::015::3_3_1_mechanical_properties_at_room_temp"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The yield and compressive strength improvements at 1273 K may be approximately 20–50%.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The W-modified alloy will retain ductility acceptable for interlayer service.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Excessive W content could reduce ductility.",
